:{"text":"それだけではない。君の中にある――濃密にして旺盛な好奇心。秘密への好奇、隠されたものを暴きたがる探究心……","source_cn":"我也能感受到你那浓烈、旺盛的好奇……对秘密的好奇，对被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86DBA100DFE1BFD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1720830041:1":{"text":"私たちは似ている。君が求めるもの、その渇きも悔しさも……かつて私が味わったものと同じだ。","source_cn":"我们是相似的。你所渴求的一切，你的渴望、你的不甘，我也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA93E32C5460F5BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1720830042:1":{"text":"そして私は、とうの昔に答えを得ている。我らの敗因はただ一つ……時が足りなかったのだ。","source_cn":"而我，早在许久前就已得出答案。我们之所以失败，只是因为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BBA4F6B9EF4AF77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1720830043:1":{"text":"不可能なることも、長き時の下には、いずれ捻じ伏せられる。これぞ不朽の身の妙なるところよ。","source_cn":"一切不可能之事，在漫长的时间下，都足以被扭转。这便是享...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9389D49ED66CD9F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1720830044:1":{"text":"ありがとな、エドガー。","source_cn":"谢谢你的好意，埃德加。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B6ECE0CB236EA8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1720830045:1":{"text":"申し訳ないが、その誘いには応じられない。","source_cn":"但抱歉，我选择拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x026AFBD6C86D48C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1720830046:1":{"text":"……ふっ。どうやら私は、まだ君を十分には理解していなかったようだ。","source_cn":"……呵，看来，我还是不够了解你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF8679678E795F57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1720830047:1":{"text":"そんなことはないさ。むしろ、あんたは怖いくらい俺のことを理解してるよ。","source_cn":"不，你很了解我。说实话，你了解我的程度都有点吓人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49936B2AE1F5D58A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1720830048:1":{"text":"あんたの言うとおりだ。俺はほしいもんが山ほどあるし、悔しかったことや心残りもたくさんある。","source_cn":"你说得对，我的确有很多想要的东西。我也的确有许多不甘和遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC842DFB40403012","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1720830049:1":{"text":"だが俺は、それ以上に限りある命の中で、そうしたものを力の限り追い続けたいんだ。","source_cn":"但我更想要的，是在有限的生命中尽力追求那些事物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E25CDB49F6D5E58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1720830050:1":{"text":"俺にとっては、結果よりも過程が大事なんだよ。","source_cn":"我更在乎这个过程，而不是结果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7C86FB042548CA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1720830051:1":{"text":"どれほど心をかき立てられる素晴らしいものでも、いつかは腐り果てちまうし……","source_cn":"更不是将这个过程拉到一个如此漫长的时间，漫长到所有曾带...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD016A3D6C3920A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1720830052:1":{"text":"俺の大切な人たちだって、みんなこの世から消えちまうだろ。","source_cn":"漫长到我所有在意的人，都已经在世界上消失不见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59664ED31C02868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1720830053:1":{"text":"なるほど。ゆえに、短い人の生を望むか。","source_cn":"所以，你更偏好短暂的人生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B022BC3E1E5A4E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1720830054:0":{"text":"ああ。でもそれだけじゃないぜ。","source_cn":"对，但还不够全面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0021097796DEFF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1720830055:1":{"text":"俺がほしいのは、短くても心から楽しめる人生だ！","source_cn":"我想要的，是短暂却快活的人生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20DE3B341D3059F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_ti